        "row": 0,
        "width": 12
      },
      "chart": {
        "name": "Golf header",
        "programText": "",
        "options": {
          "type": "Text",
          "markdown": "# Golf\n\n**Diff to beat** = the 8th-best differential in the last 20 rounds: post a lower one and it counts. **Gross to beat** converts that at the last course's rating/slope. **Oldest round counts = 1** means the next posted round pushes out a counting score, so the index can rise.\n\n[Overview](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_OVERVIEW_MISSION_CONTROL>) \u00b7 [Bot Ops](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_BOT_OPS>) \u00b7 [Trading](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_TRADING>) \u00b7 **Golf** \u00b7 [Birds](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_BIRDS>) \u00b7 [Home](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_HOME>) \u00b7 [Ops](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_OPS>)\n\nColors: green = fine, gold = watch (75% of budget used), red = act now. Tile titles say what to do."
        },
        "description": null,
        "id": "<CHART_ID_61>"
      }
    },
